<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Les Buttes Holiday Cottages" description="Privacy information for the Les Buttes Holiday Cottages website."><div class="wrap"><PageIntro eyebrow="Privacy" title="Your privacy" intro="This simple website is designed to collect as little personal information as possible."/></div><section class="section-tight paper"><div class="narrow prose"><h2>Website data</h2><p>This website does not use advertising cookies, tracking pixels or an online contact form. Our hosting provider may process basic technical logs for security and reliability.</p><h2>When you contact us</h2><p>If you email or telephone us, we use the information only to answer your enquiry and manage related correspondence.</p><h2>Airbnb and external links</h2><p>Bookings are handled by Airbnb. External services have their own privacy policies.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:info@lesbuttes.com">info@lesbuttes.com</a>.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
